  An earlier version of this header said the variables were "under this
  component's heading" in variables.toml. There was no such heading and nothing
  had been written there; it was a false statement in a committed file and is
  corrected here rather than quietly deleted.

  Coordinates are local to each parent, as the tool reports them.
-->
